        "TileImage": "$($repository fd5e4b5f-ade1-4323-8622-823b48685b9f).Image",
        "Description": "I know what you are thinking right now 47. You were supposed to sleep in Bangkok until morning, but I just got word that there are more business owners in Bangkok. They need to be eliminated as well as their partners. But tonight&apos;s mission may be more difficult than usual. This time the targets have just received word that their business partners were assassinated earlier of today, and have now started packing their bags at a rapid pace. You have about 20 minutes time, and they leave. Have fun!",
